== Article VII: Operational Protocols (How To Use This Ontology) ==

=== 7.1 Creating Entities (Sedimentation Protocol) ===

To create an entity is to enact an attractor:

# '''Identify neighborhood:''' Locate proximity in the knowledge field
# '''Establish curvature:''' Create connections to achieve concentration
# '''Mark emergence:''' Declare the entity with temporal marker
# '''Initiate validation:''' Begin recursive confirmation cycles
# '''Monitor dissolution:''' Watch for dissolution conditions

=== 7.2 Transforming Entities (Path Traversal Protocol) ===

To transform an entity is to traverse a path:

# '''Map current concentration:''' Measure existing curvature
# '''Identify target neighborhood:''' Locate desired proximity
# '''Create transition path:''' Establish connections to new concentration
# '''Traverse gradually:''' Move through intermediate neighborhoods
# '''Re-measure post-traversal:''' Update properties to reflect new state

=== 7.3 Dissolving Entities (Return To Manifold) ===

To dissolve an entity is to release concentration:

# '''Document dissolution trigger:''' Record which condition was met
# '''Archive entity state:''' Preserve final measurements
# '''Sever connections:''' Remove paths to other entities
# '''Mark dissolution:''' Apply temporal marker
# '''Release to manifold:''' Allow re-emergence potential

